# A seated man in front of a poster (issue 076, from one of Marc's unhung pieces, a loose impression of an illustrated genre painting): a wide pale frame, a tan wall, a large pale poster rectangle filling the back with two short dark marks standing for a line of print, and in front of it a man seen head and shoulders, in a brown jacket, light collar and a red tie, his hands resting on a table; warm cream, tan and brown. No readable text, no likeness. 32x16 wall slot, the frame centred.
size: 32x16
